      en: ["Founded in 1994 as Punta Sal National Park", "Area of approximately 781 square kilometers", "Named after activist Jeannette Kawas", "Home to the extensive Micos Lagoon", "Critical habitat for manatees", "Protects coral reefs and mangroves"],
